{'code': 'def _dihedral_affine(k:partial(uniform_int,0,7)):
    "Randomly flip `x` image based on `k`."
    x = -1 if k&1 else 1
    y = -1 if k&2 else 1
    if k&4: return [[0, x, 0.],
                    [y, 0, 0],
                    [0, 0, 1.]]
    return [[x, 0, 0.],
            [0, y, 0],
            [0, 0, 1.]]', 'language': 'python', 'source': 'codesearchnet'}

